# A soup bowl held in both hands, cradled from under its sides: 26 cm
# across, a stew in it, 0.8 kg in all. Its handle is the line across its
# sides the palms cradle (+x, the way the main palm faces, is the bowl's
# up), a hand at each end, the second mirroring the first.
mass 0.8
centre 0.03 0.13 0
handle 0 0 0  0 0.26 0  0.02
front 0 0 1
grip main 0.9 1.0
grip off 0.0 0.1 mirrored
hold Walk_Carry_Loop
